{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a defenseless rabbit lost in a twisted, mysterious world. Journey through horrors, cryptic rituals, and ancient powers you may never truly understand. Every step is a struggle for survival; every shadow hides a new threat.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>AWAKEN IN THE UNKNOWN</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You regain consciousness in a misty realm, not knowing how you arrived. Your only guide is a whispering voice; all around you\u2014uneasy silence and chilling dampness. But safety is fleeting: something is always hunting you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/15e747271c38c49f2bf6b3b3cc05d90a.avif?t=1760080859\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>EXPLORE AND FIGHT TO SURVIVE</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of strange locations\u2014from spectral meadows and lakes to wastelands and nightmare forests. Seek a way to escape, perform mysterious rituals, hide in burrows, and try not to become part of someone else\u2019s game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/3037bf125490f44b6a3d4b1511ed81ac.avif?t=1760080859\" width=1600 height=840 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>AVOID THE HUNTERS</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chthonic predators lurk around every corner. Each has its own danger: the bear tracks your scent, the fox stalks you in the dark, and the nightmare appears where you least expect. Be quieter than the grass and smarter than your fear if you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/b6753a9aea949265867449ecc8404796.poster.avif?t=1760080859\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/b6753a9aea949265867449ecc8404796.webm?t=1760080859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/b6753a9aea949265867449ecc8404796.mp4?t=1760080859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>OBEY OR DOUBT</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice that guides you through the night always whispers advice\u2026 but can you trust it? In this world, no one tells the whole truth, and not all forces want your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/2c08292e11b718ae20c62d6f86c0db2c.poster.avif?t=1760080859\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/2c08292e11b718ae20c62d6f86c0db2c.webm?t=1760080859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/extras/2c08292e11b718ae20c62d6f86c0db2c.mp4?t=1760080859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>WILL YOU ESCAPE THIS WORLD?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a psychological horror filled with ancient mysteries, strange rituals, and endless loneliness. Will you become the key to someone else\u2019s plans\u2014or find your own way home?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812940?t=1760080859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812940?t=1760080859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812940/5c80ad5ac11df4711a117a0cd681590f59227ce9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760080859"